<title>FINLAND: FORECAST - TAMFELT 4-MONTH PROFIT SEEN DOWN.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - TAMFELT 4-MONTH PROFIT SEEN DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Reuters survey of analysts</p>
<p>covering Finnish equities showed a 31 million markka median</p>
<p>forecast for Finnish paper manufacturing equipment supplier</p>
<p>Tamfelt Oy's January-April profit before extras and tax.</p>
<p>		     Profit before extras, tax</p>
<p>			   (FIM million)</p>
<p>    Median		  31</p>
<p>    Mean		    32.2</p>
<p>    Lowest		  29</p>
<p>    Highest		 37</p>
<p>(Forecasts by five analysts</p>
<p>Tamfelt's results are due on June 5 at 0830/0530 GMT.</p>
<p>In January-April 1996, Tamfelt posted a profit of 34.7</p>
<p>million markka.</p>
<p>Contributors to the survey were Aktia Bank, Aros Securities,</p>
<p>Evli Securities, FIM Securities and Merita Securities.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom 358-9-680 50 292, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
